WEBVTT

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.880
What's wrong today?

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.360
Ennui.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:15.970
Where did you learn that word?

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.820
Autumn brings out the melancholy in people.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:28.410
<i>Is this caused by something she saw on TV?</i>

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:30.370
When those leaves fall...

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.780
I'm sure my life will fall too.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:34.920
I see.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.120
Good for you.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.320
And on that note!

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:43.120
Autumn sports, autumn arts, autumn foods!

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:48.370
In order to cheer you up, I've prepared a bunch of things we can do!

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:50.220
What do you mean?

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.360
Which do you want to do?

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:56.960
I put them in order starting from sports, arts, and food.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:57.570
Let's see...

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.880
I recommend food!

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:03.190
I didn't bring it, but there's also autumn amusement parks.

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:05.330
Maybe we should go to a hot spring?

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:06.730
Just kidding!

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:15.980
Autumn silence.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:58.790
I'm feeling great today!

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:00.890
The autumn breeze feels great!

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:06.820
That looks like a great container!

00:03:18.620 --> 00:03:20.460
What are you up to this early?

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:22.570
Is that you, Sonya-chan?

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.620
This is my anti-Sonya-chan armor!

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:27.800
Don't say crap like that right in front of me.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:31.410
If I wear this on my head, I'll be protected from any attacks!

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:33.910
Check this out!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:34.670
Look!

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.490
Try to hit me!

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:37.090
S-Stay away...

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:40.830
Come on, let's go!

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:39.560
This is scary...

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:40.830
So scary!

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:48.280
Sonya-chan, where did you go?

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:50.300
Don't shout out my name like that!

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:51.770
Ah, there you are.

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:54.630
Speaking of which, I'm surprised you knew it was me.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:56.990
You're the only person who'd do this.

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:59.350
Or am I now?

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:02.830
What if it were someone else inside this?

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:07.770
That's true. You might be an enemy targeting me.

00:04:07.770 --> 00:04:09.130
I was lying!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:11.820
It's really me, the real one!

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:19.560
Perhaps I should reveal who I am now!

00:04:19.560 --> 00:04:21.270
You just said it was you though.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.130
Huh?

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:24.110
What's wrong?

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.390
Oh, uh... nothing.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:30.080
I'll show you my true self next week!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:31.700
You're stuck, aren't you.

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:37.170
Help me! Take it off!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.060
Alright, already! Get off!

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.960
It's tighter than I thought.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.960
Ow ow ow ow ow!

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.430
Will it come off if I twist it?

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:52.650
It feels like I just got spun around a lot...

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:54.510
Is this... behind me?

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:57.330
Did I spin it too much?

00:04:58.170 --> 00:04:59.550
Let's try the other way.

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:05.860
I think I'm facing the right way now...

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:10.760
Damn it, I asked you for help and you're not even helping at all.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.430
Dummy, dummy, dummy!

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:21.970
I put this on because I knew that would happen.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:22.770
Really.

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:23.570
Good for you.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:26.840
Is something troubling you?

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.860
Is that you, Agiri-san?

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:34.040
I see. So you put a can that you found thrown away on the street on your head,

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.520
and now you can't take it off.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:37.530
That's right!

00:05:37.530 --> 00:05:38.990
Please help me!

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:42.730
There are a few ways to remove it.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:46.710
Oh! Please use the most effective one!

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.840
Understood.

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:56.070
First, we cover it with a handkerchief.

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:58.970
A magic trick?

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:02.140
One, two, three!

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:06.100
Then we remove the handkerchief...

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.800
and the can is totally gone!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:10.920
Wow!

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:12.900
Hey.

00:06:13.290 --> 00:06:15.030
You just stuck a picture on it.

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:16.730
You're right!

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.450
It's still dark!

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:21.200
Now I'll take my leave.

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.450
She hasn't fixed anything and she left?!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.410
Agiri-san!

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:31.070
Wh-What do I do, Sonya-chan?

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.290
Like I'd know.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:36.640
Well, since I can't do anything about it, let's just go to school!

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:37.920
Go to the hospital.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.920
What should I make tonight?

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.760
Maybe nabe?

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:51.580
So, could you carry me to school, Sonya-chan?

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.810
Why?

00:06:52.810 --> 00:06:54.830
No way, it's embarrassing.

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:56.350
You're hopeless.

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.430
Fine, then just guide me by hand.

00:06:58.430 --> 00:06:59.610
Here, paw.

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:09.720
Receive and attack!

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:13.380
Receive and attack!

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:17.220
All right, I've made it to class safe and sound.

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:21.170
Now let's think up some scientific way of removing this.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.690
Scientific way?

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:26.760
I think if you heat up metal, it expands.

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:29.730
That's it! I'll leave that to you!

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:33.730
Mmm! This is where cooking is done!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:38.320
Can't you think of any other way?

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:41.080
There aren't many places in school where we can use fire.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:43.440
This is a little harsh!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:46.250
Let's try something else first!

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:48.210
Fine then.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:56.870
Ew, it's all slippery...

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:00.670
Ow ow ow ow ow!

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:03.390
Ow! Ow ow ow!

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:06.690
No good.

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:08.400
It's not coming off.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:11.580
Is something troubling you?

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:12.440
Oh, she's back.

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.270
Agiri-san! Help me out for real this time!

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:21.840
I see. So you tried to remove the can by pouring oil inside it.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.270
It didn't go very well.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:27.790
Please help, Agiri-san! This is a huge problem!

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.790
Understood.

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.760
Leave it to me.

00:09:06.390 --> 00:09:08.110
Now I'll take my leave.

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:12.250
She didn't fix anything and left again?!

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.290
Looks like this is our only option.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:19.650
Stop! This is a bad idea!

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:22.300
The oil's going to catch fire!

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:25.190
How many scallions should we buy?

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:30.210
That was so scary...

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:31.680
So boring.

00:09:32.390 --> 00:09:33.640
I got it!

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:36.500
It may come off with force!

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:37.750
Hit me!

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:38.890
Are you sure?

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.640
Yeah! Give it all you got!

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:46.380
I meant... hit my face.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:48.280
No way. That'd hurt.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:51.640
Then what's the point?!

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:52.660
It came off!

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.370
Yay! Yay!

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:58.930
But why?

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:02.130
Maybe after wearing it for a while, it adjusted to the size of your head?

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:05.980
Yeah! Now I can wear it whenever I please!

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:15.870
Or maybe it just happened to come off.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:36.970
Sonya's desk.

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:46.930
What are you doing?

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:50.740
I was going to replace one of the lights.

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:52.810
Get your shoes off.

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.790
Tell me what you did.

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.780
Let go of my finger!

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:02.080
What the heck did you put in here?

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:08.180
A music magazine?

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.330
Is this yours?

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:12.240
Nope! Dunno whose it is!

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:13.100
I see.

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:14.070
Then I don't need it.

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:15.880
Waaaaait!

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:27.680
You're mean!

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:29.950
You totally knew!

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.060
Don't say you don't know, then.

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:35.840
You put something else in here, didn't you?

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:38.280
Tambourine?

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:39.320
This is...

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:42.700
You brought something like that to school?

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:44.560
Have you taken an interest in music?

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:45.480
Here.

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.890
What are you trying to do?

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.870
I have no interest in music or instruments.

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:54.550
Wouldn't it be cool to play one, though?

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:56.530
Let's learn to play together!

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:57.730
With a tambourine?

00:11:57.730 --> 00:12:00.070
If it's us two, we'll make such a great performance.

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:01.510
No thanks.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:07.630
Our band is already breaking apart...

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:10.600
We don't even have a band to break apart.

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:13.590
Besides, an idiot can't play an instrument.

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:15.730
Wha—! How rude!

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:18.590
Well, since you're not an idiot, can you play it?!

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.350
O-Of course.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.070
Go ahead then.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:32.910
It's like I'm watching a play.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:40.340
Even if you can't play such a simple instrument, this is pushing it!

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:43.090
You're the one who can't play!

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:46.520
Ha! You underestimate me! I can play the flute!

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:48.050
I doubt it.

00:12:55.040 --> 00:12:59.680
Where did I put the shopping list my wife gave me?

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:03.680
Anyway, music is great!

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:06.160
Drop the knives and pick up an instrument!

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:08.890
That's pretty arrogant of you.

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.630
I've got the perfect instrument for you, Sonya-chan.

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:12.370
Here.

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.410
Maracas?

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:18.040
It's what a baby shakes around.

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:20.090
How cute!

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:31.720
Despite her looks, she's quite a violent baby...

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:36.940
Right! We'll take that anger and use it in an instrument you can beat!

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.780
You just need an isntrument you can beat on to refresh yourself.

00:13:46.460 --> 00:13:48.610
You're right, that worked.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:50.200
So mean...

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:52.530
You're supposed to hit the instrument!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.170
Don't tell me you were thinking "I'll play the tune of death for you!"

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:58.230
or some typical assassin line like that?

00:13:58.230 --> 00:13:58.900
Gross!

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.020
"Gross"?!

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:04.680
This instrument makes a horrible sound.

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:09.840
Actually, I have an instrument from a while back.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.530
This.

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:12.980
Wow!

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:15.360
Play anything for me.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:22.050
Yeah, you suck.

00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:25.760
Did you think it was just a flute?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.980
I... I see. That is amazing.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:30.440
Let me see it.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:36.000
...Psyche! I got it!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.370
Tricking me with a trap like that...

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:46.090
I wasn't trying to.

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:52.270
If we keep walking, our feet will go flat.

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:58.740
Just you watch! I'll blow you away in one hit!

00:14:58.740 --> 00:15:00.600
Do it yourself.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.930
Geez.

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:11.000
Did it work?

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:15.060
Don't use those things in here!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:16.480
Where did you get them from?!

00:15:17.130 --> 00:15:18.590
From the music room!

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:24.040
Don't go shouting like that.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.650
You'll look like an idiot.

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:31.070
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:32.160
Good.

00:15:34.890 --> 00:15:38.960
I'll give you this special flute, so please forgive me.

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:44.380
No sound comes out.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.990
A dog whistle?!

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:52.570
Damn it!

00:15:56.410 --> 00:15:59.180
I win! You fell for it!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.690
What are you doing?

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.270
Hold this for a sec.

00:16:15.270 --> 00:16:16.810
What's this?

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:20.290
All right...

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:23.580
You weren't planning on throwing that at me, were you?

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:29.930
A-Actually, I figured out I have a special skill when playing darts.

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:31.080
Darts?

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.870
Yesterday, at my house...

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.110
Don't move...

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:44.080
I think I have a special talent for darts!

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:48.500
Wait! Let me finish!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:51.440
Let me test this out.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:54.510
I don't have any, so I'll have to make them.

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.730
I can't make it out of paper...

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.530
It went in with one throw!

00:17:09.530 --> 00:17:11.320
I must be gifted at this!

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:14.240
That's how it was.

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.590
That has nothing to do with darts.

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:18.720
It's all about control!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.350
It was just by chance.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.200
Try it again.

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:29.990
That has nothing to do with darts.

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:31.370
What were you thinking?

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:38.430
I hear that winter comes at the same time for everyone in the northern hemisphere.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:40.310
Don't you know?

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:46.280
You can always go buy some darts equipment, you know.

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.670
But I don't have any money...

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:51.360
Because you keep wasting it on stupid crap.

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:54.880
So I'll just make my own.

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:57.450
It's done!

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.260
All right, I've made it.

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:01.780
Let's play!

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:05.720
It's just another target board.

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:08.210
Just use a knife.

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:12.230
Isn't that great?! Your knives are actually useful!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:18.640
Don't tell me your arm is too weak to throw.

00:18:19.590 --> 00:18:22.100
Wow! What a shot!

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:24.560
Now try that in the game.

00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:28.190
Once I hit it in the 100 point zone, we're done.

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:29.570
And if you miss?

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:31.270
Like hell I will.

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:34.080
What if. Just what if.

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:36.470
If I miss, we'll keep playing.

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:38.270
Really?

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:41.990
With you as the target.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.900
There. I hit it right in the center.

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.670
Yay! You missed!

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:51.140
What?! Cut the crap!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:58.270
That's cheating!

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:04.100
A pro should graciously accept losses!

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:09.970
Now, for your punishment, we'll keep playing.

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:11.480
100 points.

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:12.650
50 points.

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:21.940
Don't tell me you actually intended to play with me as the target from the start?

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:24.120
It's a magic marker, so don't worry.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:25.620
That's not what I was asking!

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:27.130
Ta-da!

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:30.120
I have this toy suction cup gun!

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.960
You have no money because you buy crap like that!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:37.600
I know. Why don't we have a competition instead.

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:39.380
Wh-What?

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:43.330
Where did I leave that shopping list...

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:46.920
She'll be angry if I'm not home soon.

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:52.550
0... points?

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:57.640
Why 0 points?! Your score doesn't change!

00:19:57.640 --> 00:20:00.530
I didn't feel like writing a higher score.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:02.580
That's annoying! Take this!

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:03.690
Surprise attack!

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:08.110
All right. I got 20 points.

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.600
Wh-When did she get my hand...

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:16.540
Anyway, I'll win at any rate.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:18.540
You got an amazing score before.

00:20:18.540 --> 00:20:19.670
That doesn't matter.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:24.530
My head's worth 0 points, so no matter how many times you hit me, it's fine.

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:28.600
Now, go on and shoot as much as you please...

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:33.270
Oh no! I forgot to take out the combustible trash yesterday!

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:41.180
I might not get any points, but I can still beat you till it hurts.

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:44.030
You're mean! That's where food goes!

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:45.920
But you had your big mouth open.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:47.580
Now, look this way.

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:54.920
I'm invincible if I don't turn around!

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:01.280
When did you mark my back...?

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.980
From the start.

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:04.580
Anyway, I win.

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:07.060
I'm going to wipe this off my head since it's embarrassing.

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.810
Wait!

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:13.230
As expected, I actually used a permanent marker.

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:17.440
That's such a cliched mistake...!

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:19.280
I'm sorry!

00:21:19.720 --> 00:21:22.840
There is "0 points" written on your head too, you idiot!

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.490
That's right!

00:21:24.490 --> 00:21:26.990
I don't want to have 0 points, that's embarrassing!

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:30.950
I'll... I'll...

00:22:00.340 --> 00:22:03.690
In the end, they couldn't remove it.

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:10.120
Getting Stuck, Playing Instruments, Thrusting.
